sequenceDiagram
participant API as "mainController: Controller"
participant Service as "allocationTraceService: Service"
participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
API->>+Service: persistPriceTrace(planVersion, fragments)
Service->>+DB: Save base price, batch, HSD, rule, discount and final price
DB-->>-Service: Trace persisted with version
Service-->>-API: Stored trace result
API->>+Service: GET /api/v1/allocation-runs/orders/{orderId}/price
Service->>+DB: Read approved or proposal-version price trace
DB-->>-Service: Immutable fragment breakdown
Service-->>-API: Price history with version/status
Note over Service,DB: Historical orders never recalculate using current configuration


